{"id":"0f1bc9f2ca197a0e","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-ordinal-successor-properties.md","title":"Ordinal Successor Properties","display":"thm-ordinal-successor-properties — Ordinal Successor Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ordinal-successor-properties","aliases":["58-thm-ordinal-successor-properties"],"display":"thm-ordinal-successor-properties — Ordinal Successor Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-successor.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ordinal-successor-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ordinal-successor-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ordinal-successor-properties — Ordinal Successor Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"45f08db7cdccaf0b\" href=\"?note=45f08db7cdccaf0b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-successor.md\">../batch16/58-df-successor.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\)</span> (ordinal candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Succ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Succ}:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}successor\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha))\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\n\\to\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\beta\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}successor\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha))\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\n\\to\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\beta\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The successor ordinal is the least ordinal strictly above its predecessor.</li>\n<li>Ordinality of the successor is stated explicitly alongside the sourced successor relation and its leastness property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-successor.md","status":"resolved","id":"45f08db7cdccaf0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-successor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Succ}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}successor\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to{}&\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha))\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\n\\to\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\beta\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1229,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4341","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-ordinal-successor-properties.md|58-thm-ordinal-successor-properties]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","45f08db7cdccaf0b"]}